{"name": "SAMUKID", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">SAMUKID is the story of a child traveling with a blind companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become the protagonist of a legendary journey with your eccentric yet strong partner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/732483b75e27db42f170b3ca69e8d9e7.avif?t=1777495878\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/dc8e6c616859cc978825a0ebf501736b.poster.avif?t=1777495878\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/dc8e6c616859cc978825a0ebf501736b.webm?t=1777495878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/dc8e6c616859cc978825a0ebf501736b.mp4?t=1777495878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your blind companion handles the battles, while you, small and agile, take charge of movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sometimes you must pull your ally away from danger to survive, and other times push them into the heart of enemies to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategic positioning of allies and foes can also maximize your skill effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/93c77fbc6801555fb5a6433c16d599a5.avif?t=1777495878\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/fd6d9bc9b982ddbccb1c44796748b560.poster.avif?t=1777495878\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/fd6d9bc9b982ddbccb1c44796748b560.webm?t=1777495878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/fd6d9bc9b982ddbccb1c44796748b560.mp4?t=1777495878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat monsters to earn loot and gold, then build your skill and loot decks to unleash powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trade for essential items or recruit mighty allies through special events to strengthen your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine skills, loot, and companions to craft your own strategies and experience fresh battles each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With the perfect synergy, you might even crush bosses with overwhelming power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"198\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/4d9711f81b1daab7f1987622bd0cb796.avif?t=1777495878\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"468\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/47c57abdc66eaf6fd4d7180b8a6d7c68.poster.avif?t=1777495878\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/47c57abdc66eaf6fd4d7180b8a6d7c68.webm?t=1777495878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/extras/47c57abdc66eaf6fd4d7180b8a6d7c68.mp4?t=1777495878\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as unique characters such as a balanced samurai or a powerful but slow sorcerer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Different bosses and regions await, each demanding new tactics depending on their combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge new builds with every run and enjoy your own distinctive combat style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "SAMUKID is a unique strategic action roguelike deck-building game where combat and movement are separate roles. Build powerful synergies between dice-based battles and grid-based movement, and lead the blind samurai and his young companion on a legendary journey!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876950/d513c3ca881706064d78b10bd20852983cc2a777/header.jpg?t=1777495878", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Deckbuilding", "Grid-Based Movement", "Dice", "Roguelite", "Roguelike"], "developers": "ArmedPeseant", "publishers": "ArmedPeseant", "release_date": "Apr 29, 2026", "price": "$5.99", "appid": "3876950", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/6xZ16FoOR94", "first_seen": 1777413600.0, "review_rank": 758}